ツカサをやたらとコキ使っては身の回りの世話をさせたりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのせいか、ツカサが来てからはアルシアに少し嫉妬されている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48766"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1fc5cfc27b7a08a3f9a2445405ab6d369e8f38056c08196d8e079ddd5d49925.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44f4df584c543ef6b45d0af21392afc4cbb855d825cbb9f5fd0bcc884aadef75.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131577:48766:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c40827","characterName":"ツカサ・ストロビラントゥス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"48772","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131577"},{"characterId":"48772","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198667"}],"egsCharacterIds":["3084"],"vndbCharacterId":"c40827"},"originalCharacterName":"ツカサ・ストロビラントゥス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"★A beautiful boy protagonist with sexy, magical 'eyes'★"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this story. He is slender and delicate in appearance, with a beautiful face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a bright, positive, and serious personality, but looks considerably younger than his age (shota type) and is often mistaken for a girl."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In reality, however, he possesses a remarkably large penis and is incredibly virile. Due to a certain incident, he gains the magical power to \"make members of the opposite sex intensely aroused just by making eye contact.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While training in magic under the old magician Hasturgal, he was one day invited to the magic academy by Sylvia and admitted through a special program. Tsukasa's goal at this magic academy is to learn magic and gain control of his 'eye' ability."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40827"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"この物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見は細身で華奢、容姿端麗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢よりもかなり幼く、少女と間違われることもしばしば（ショタ系）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく前向きで真面目な性格。実はかなりの巨根の持ち主で超絶倫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事件が原因で「目を合わせただけで異性をエロエロに発情させてしまう」という魔法の力を持ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"老魔術師ハスターガルの元で魔術の修行をしていた彼はある日、シルヴィアに魔法学院に招かれ、特別枠で入学することになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ツカサのこの魔法学院での目的は、魔術を学んで『眼』の能力を制御できるようになることである。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3084","sourceWorkId":"4551","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"種族：人間　国籍：なし（ウィザーディア魔法学院所属）　職業：魔法使い見習い"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：読書／入浴／料理　好き：書籍（特に古文書）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦手：暗闇（失明時の記憶が原因？）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウィザーディア魔法学院の生徒でシルヴィアのお供兼お目付役。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回の件はシルヴィアと二人きりでの長期休暇扱いということで、ウィザーディア魔法学院内でも色々と物議を醸していたらしい（主に騒いでいたのは３人の学生と淫魔だとか）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"得意とするのは戦闘においては補助的な魔法。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"モンスターの弱点属性の分析などアナライズの才もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強大な魔力を秘めた『アウグストの眼』も、現在ではその力を制御できるようになっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3084","sourceWorkId":"11675","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"この作品の主人公。外見は細身で華奢、容姿端麗。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢よりもかなり幼く、少女と間違えられることもしばしば（ショタ系）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく前向きで真面目な性格。実はかなりの巨根の持ち主で超絶倫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事件が原因で「目を合わせただけで異性をエロエロに発情させてしまう」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"という魔法の力を持ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"老魔術師ハスターガルの元で魔術の修行をしていた彼はある日、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シルヴィアに魔法学院に招かれ、いつの間にか特別枠で入学することになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性と全く縁のない環境で育ったことなどから女性はやや苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園での目的は、魔術を学んで『眼』の能力を制御できるようになることである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学院の上階、シルヴィアの隣の部屋を宛われ、そこで生活している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"炊事・洗濯・掃除などの生活能力は極めて高く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこをシルヴィアに見込まれて彼女の身の回りの世話をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事や洗濯、掃除などはほとんど全て彼の担当となっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"48772"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40827","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3084","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"3084","value":"女性"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a716ff454a3e959778d606b12c9f07968a094cab8330bd4899a8c02d636220a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f1849f61dffa59699dd9afafd389bf04aff69049b1190dadb50e784ad8edf07.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"萩原えみこ","creatorId":"vndb:s867","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s867","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s867","name":"萩原 えみこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131577:48772:4854:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c40819","characterName":"ミズチ・マオ・ホムラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c40819"},"originalCharacterName":"ミズチ・マオ・ホムラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kabane's sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40819"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/73/73d599897dd9812646a4eb619dbe935016e303a2a28dbe10d0952d7721f46b47.we